      "amount": "1 teaspoon",
      "notes": "For added flavor"
    },
    {
      "name": "Fresh cilantro",
      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "For garnish"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lime juice",
      "amount": "2 tablespoons",
      "notes": "For serving"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "1. In a large bowl, whisk together kefir yogurt, Kenyan chili flakes, honey, and grill seasoning.",
    "2. Add the chicken to the marinade and mix well to coat.",
    "3. Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes or up to 2 hours.",
    "4. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "5. Thread the marinated chicken onto skewers.",
    "6. Grill the chicken for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, or until cooked through.",
    "7. Garnish with fresh cilantro and serve with lime wedges."
